#: scenario:scenario_23DC6B01_83EC_42FB_8E1C_A0D23A5383B2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 99ad71c778814b7ece1be76dc10d7f44b73c2af6a6250e3164d5db0171946dae
