#: scenario:scenario_DD82605B_296C_4B08_8924_289114001EE2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1ece3a218920723b4b7b0752fe731fd4332d75cab319cad75de3a7cc38a8d4ef
